  "ingredients": [
    "1 large egg",
    "1 tablespoon butter (melted)",
    "1 tablespoon almond flour",
    "1 tablespoon psyllium husk powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon cream of tartar",
    "1 tablespoon chicken broth"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Crack an egg into a mug with a wide base. Alternatively, you can use a large ramekin for a smallish bun.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-microwave-hamburger-bun/#wprm-recipe-51097-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/low-carb-microwave-hamburger-bun-step-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microwave butter for 10-15 seconds to melt it. Once melted, pour over the egg and whisk well to aerate the mixture. The eggs should become slightly lighter in color.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-microwave-hamburger-bun/#wprm-recipe-51097-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/low-carb-microwave-hamburger-bun-step-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the almond flour, psyllium husk powder, baking powder, cream of tartar, and chicken broth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-microwave-hamburger-bun/#wprm-recipe-51097-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/low-carb-microwave-hamburger-bun-step-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix everything well to form a slightly doughy mixture, wiping off any excess stuck to the edge of the cup to make the top as uniform as possible.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-microwave-hamburger-bun/#wprm-recipe-51097-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/low-carb-microwave-hamburger-bun-step-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microwave for 60–75 seconds, depending on the microwave. If it puffs up quickly, don't worry — it will reduce in size greatly once taken out. Once out, flip the mug over and tap it lightly against a plate to slide the bun out. Cut in half, toast, and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-microwave-hamburger-bun/#wprm-recipe-51097-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/low-carb-microwave-hamburger-bun-step-05.jpg"
    }
  ],
